{"language_code": "eng", "language_probability": 1.0, "text": "What if you could remove the music from YouTube videos and keep the voices? Now you can with Musicless. Lectures, documentaries, lessons, even recipes. So much of YouTube comes with music. Whether you avoid music for your faith or just wanna hear every word, Musicless is made for you. Setting it up takes three clicks. Find Musicless on the Chrome Web Store and click Add to Chrome. Then Add extension, and Turn on Musicless. Done. Now play a video. In seconds, the music is removed and the voices stay. Want the original sound? Just click the Musicless icon on the player. Here's why you'll love it. It's completely free. No account, no ads. It works offline right on your computer. Nothing is ever uploaded. It's light. It runs on an ordinary laptop. No graphics card needed. There's nothing else to install, just the extension. And it works on Windows, Mac, Linux, and Chrome OS. Get Musicless free on the Chrome Web Store and Firefox add-ons. Install it now and watch YouTube without the music", "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 0.1, "end": 0.18, "type": "word", "logprob": -0.00017963226127903908}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.18, "end": 0.24, "type": "spacing", "logprob": 0.0}, {"text": "if", "start": 0.24, "end": 0.32, "type": "word", "logprob": 0.0}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.32, "end": 0.36, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"text": "you", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.42, "type": "word", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.42, "end": 0.44, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"text": "could", "start": 0.44, "end": 0.54, "type": "word", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.54, "end": 0.6, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"text": "remove", "start": 0.6, "end": 0.92, "type": "word", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.92, "end": 0.94, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -2.622600959512056e